# debug.keystore is intentionally committed -- it's RN's universally
# known, non-secret debug-signing keystore (same file/password in every
# RN project), needed for CI's release-build smoke test to sign at all.
# A real production release keystore IS a genuine secret -- never commit it.
packages/mobile/android/app/release.keystore
packages/mobile/android/keystore.properties
packages/mobile/ios/Pods/

